  "expected": "Fair-Use policy enforces tier invariants, aggregates member usage across multiple serving exits (node \u0026 node2), transitions from shadow to enforce mode and across usage thresholds by recompiling only carrying exits, installing Tier 2 kernel tc classes on both exits, and clearing fair_use.applying from true to false once both carrying exits acknowledge the compiled generation, while ignoring duplicate/replayed events and preserving per-incarnation retained usage across node re-enrollment.",
  "actual": "PR #222 Fair-Use recompile \u0026 fair_use.applying ACK convergence and PR #210 ENR-03 per-incarnation retained usage are verified live on 01a18f2d-e7d6-770e-9b8c-edb2016a7db9 (node) and 01a18fc6-fb50-793b-b824-718838f20496 (node2): Transition 1 (policy.activated mode=enforce: carrying gens node 117-\u003e119, node2 4-\u003e7, non-carrying 0-\u003e0; fair_use.applying true-\u003efalse in 5384 ms via observation 139ab64b-59a5-4b60-84d7-73c8eddfbe9b; replay no double bump) and Transition 2 (fup.member_generation_changed: carrying gens node 119-\u003e120, node2 7-\u003e8, non-carrying 0-\u003e0; fair_use.applying true-\u003efalse in 6141 ms via observation c14761e0-9137-49ef-9b15-f4d920babbe7; replay no double bump), plus ENR-03 re-enrollment (01a18fc6-fc7d-73f6-bf0c-6d8abb6fd46b -\u003e 01a18fc8-90a6-781b-ab46-c0a6531d96ed). Live Tier 2 kernel tc installation on node/node2 is blocked by VerifyServing FLOWTABLE_BYPASS on Docker's ip nat POSTROUTING chain (obs=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000).",
  "blockers": [
    "w1-netlab / w3-devstack-e2e: PR #220 (2473acf, node/enforce/verify_foreign.go) added whole-ruleset foreign-chain verification to VerifyServing; in deploy/devstack, Docker Engine installs table ip nat (POSTROUTING -\u003e DOCKER_POSTROUTING -\u003e xt target SNAT for 127.0.0.11 loopback DNS) inside node-netns and node2-netns, causing VerifyServing to fail with FLOWTABLE_BYPASS (\"table nat family ip hook postrouting priority 100 chain POSTROUTING statement xt\") and roll back table inet fvpn to fvpn_generation=0 whenever d.Serve=true."
